-   Fit the reduced and full model


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
m_int_vr_red = gapm %>% 
  lm(formula = life_exp ~ CP_c + VR_c)
m_int_vr_full = gapm %>%
  lm(formula = life_exp ~ CP_c + VR_c + CP_c*VR_c)
```
